spell_flavour_text = "He doesn't hit you. He returns what you were always going to receive."
theory_desc = "Newton's Third Law. The caster redirects their own mana pressure as an equal-opposite force pair through their conductor. Not force generation — force redirection. The caster must brace or absorb partial mana backlash. Visualisation anchor: you are the wall. The opponent is what hits it."
